                            <p></p><h3>Definition of "thiersch":</h3><p>Microphones tagged <b>Thiersch</b> use capsules built by Sigfried Thiersch, former Gefell capsule technician and currently one of only two commercial sources of PVC-diaphragm M7 capsules in the world.</p><p>Thiersch&#8217; &#8220;blue line&#8221; uses PVC membranes. The company&#8217;s &#8220;red line&#8221; M7 uses Mylar membranes.</p><p>Read more at the <a href="http://www.thiersch-mic.de/">Thiersch</a> website.</p>
